# Optional cross-device sync (Iteration 8+, Supabase) - see ONBOARDING.md's
# "Enabling cross-device sync (Supabase)" section for the full setup steps.
#
# Both of these are OPTIONAL. Leave them unset (or delete this file's copy,
# don't create a real .env at all) and the app works exactly as it always
# has: fully local-first, no sign-in offered, no network calls to Supabase.
#
# Copy this file to .env in this directory (app/.env) and fill in the two
# values from your own Supabase project's dashboard (Project Settings ->
# Data API) to turn sign-in/sync on locally. For Netlify, set the same two
# keys in Site configuration -> Environment variables instead of a .env file.

PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
